# Wireframe: Project Card

## Purpose & Flow Context

The Project Card displays project summary with real-time update support via optimistic updates. Entry: user views project list. Exit: user clicks card to navigate to project detail.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: Project card is part of project list or grid layout.

**App-shell**: Project card is within main content area.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Project Card | Icon, name, progress bar, member avatars | Clickable card, hover state |

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  🚀  Frontend Redesign                                         |
|  [============================----] 75%                          |
|  [👤][👤][👤]                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Project Icon | Icon | Shows project icon or emoji | None |
| Project Name | Text | Click navigates to project detail | Truncates with ellipsis if too long |
| Progress Bar | Progress | Shows project completion percentage | None |
| Member Avatars | Avatar stack | Shows project members | Shows +N if more than 3 |

## Data Display

Project cards are displayed in a list or grid layout. Each card shows:
- Project icon
- Project name
- Progress bar with percentage
- Member avatars (stacked)

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Project Icon | Identifies the project | 🚀 Rocket, 🎯 Target, 📊 Chart, etc. |
| Project Name | Describes the project | User-friendly name |
| Progress Bar | Shows completion status | "75%" or visual bar |
| Member Avatars | Shows team members | User avatars or initials |

## States

### Idle (Default)

Card shows project with normal styling.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  🚀  Frontend Redesign                                         |
|  [============================----] 75%                          |
|  [👤][👤][👤]                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Optimistic (Project Update)

Card shows pulse animation on changed field, new value displayed immediately.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  🚀  Frontend Redesign v2                                       |
|  [============================----] 75%                          |
|  [👤][👤][👤]                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
  (project name has pulse animation)
```

### Confirmed (Update Complete)

Card shows brief green flash on updated field, then returns to normal.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  🚀  Frontend Redesign v2                                       |
|  [============================----] 75%                          |
|  [👤][👤][👤]                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
  (project name had brief green flash)
```

### Reverted (Update Failed)

Card shows flash red on reverted field, returns to original value.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  🚀  Frontend Redesign                                         |
|  [============================----] 75%                          |
|  [👤][👤][👤]                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
  (project name had brief red flash, reverted to original)
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full card layout with all elements |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Compact layout, progress bar may hide |
| Mobile (<768px) | Minimal layout, member avatars may hide |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | Card is within main landmark |
| Heading order | Card title is h3 within article |
| Reading / Focus order | Tab to card, Enter/Space navigates to project |
| Accessible names | Card: aria-label="Project: {name}, Progress: {percentage}%" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab to card, Enter/Space navigates |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on entire card |
| Focus not obscured | Card focus ring visible |
| Non-color intent | Progress bar + percentage text, not just color |
